            {
                "drawing_id": "a60f2d6c-4298-4ff5-903d-18a504ed7a19",
                "locked": false,
                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"470\" height=\"296\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">1. Configure the switchport connecting switches as trunk port\n    Disable DTP on the port\n    Configure the administrative and operational mode of each interface\n\n2. Configure SW1in VTP dmaine CCNA \n    Create VLANs 10,20, and 30 on SW1.\n    Have SW2 and SW3 added VLAN 10,20 ,and 30\n\n3. Configure SW2 in VTP tranparent mode \n    Add VLAN 10 to SW2\n    Is VLAN 10 added to the VLAN database or SW1/SW3\n\n4. Configure SW3 in VTP client mode .\n    Try to configure VLAN 50 on SW3 is added?\n\n5. COnfigure all switchport connected to host in the correct VLAN \n    Manualy configure the as access ports.\n    Is DTP still enabled on the switchport</text></svg>",
                "x": -934,
                "y": 172,
                "z": 2
            }
